{\\sqrt{2}}r\\operatorname{ln}⁡({r}^{2}+1)\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Rewriting a Double Integral Over a Circle or Part-Circle Centered at the Origin"}]}
